        "Official manufacturer sources identify ValvTechnologies as a United States designer and manufacturer of metal-seated isolation and control valves for severe-service conditions. Its engineering scope addresses high-temperature, high-pressure, abrasive and corrosive process duties.",
        "The documented portfolio covers V Series metal-seated ball valves, IsoTech parallel-slide gate valves, TrunTech trunnion ball valves, coking and switching valves, slurry and HPAL/POx autoclave valves, electronic relief and nuclear check valves, protective coatings and pneumatic or hydraulic actuation. Published applications include power, oil and gas, refining, mining, pulp and paper, aerospace and other process industries."
